ParseModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Frontend entry point: tokenizes the source (ParseLines), builds the node skeleton (BuildNodes), assigns names (ApplyNodeNames) and properties (ApplyProps), links children (LinkChildren), and returns the root AST.
    Provides: Parse(source) -> ast.
    DependsOn: ParseLines, BuildNodes, ApplyNodeNames, ApplyProps, LinkChildren.
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../Parse/Parse.sir).
